[0.756919, "o", "-- REQ-UA-004 | openspec/changes/add-mfa/specs/user-auth/spec.md:5 | active | requested\r\n### Requirement: REQ-UA-004 Second factor\r\nThe system SHALL ask for a TOTP code after a valid password.\r\n\r\n#### Scenario: SCN-UA-004-1 Valid code\r\n- **WHEN** the user enters the current TOTP code\r\n- **THEN** the system opens a session\r\n\r\n#### Scenario: SCN-UA-004-2 Expired code\r\n- **WHEN** the user enters a code older than 30 seconds\r\n- **THEN** the system rejects it\r\n\r\n-- add-mfa/1.3 | openspec/changes/add-mfa/tasks.md:7 | open | task cites REQ-UA-004\r\n- [ ] 1.3 Add the TOTP prompt to the login form. [REQ-UA-004] Verify: `grep -q totp src/login.ts`\r\n\r\n-- tests/login.test.ts:1 | tests/login.test.ts:1 | active | covers REQ-UA-004\r\n-- bundle 711 chars, 3.6% of 19702 chars of spec text\r\n"]
